SELECT ?item #?itemLabel
(CONCAT("\u007C {","{rfd links\u007C",strafter(str(?item), "entity/"),"\u007Cfrom [[Wikidata:Database reports/to delete/empty Wikinews items]]}","}") as ?del)
{
  	VALUES ?instance { wd:Q17633526 } .
	?item wdt:P31 ?instance .
	OPTIONAL { ?sitelink schema:about ?item } .
  	FILTER (!BOUND(?sitelink)) .
	# SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en" }
}
ORDER BY ?item
LIMIT 5000
